        "notes": "The Marine Protected Area, Coral Coast ( APACC- ICMBio) provides most of the Infrastructure for this site. There are two scientific bases, where the researchers can stay during the expeditions to collect data. There are dorm rooms and offices, power and running water. Only one of the stations has internet They also can arrange transportation ( both car and boat, if asked in good advance). ",
